      html: "<h2>One-Tap Clock In and Out</h2>\n<p>Timing starts with a single tap. Tap the button when you start work and the app begins timing immediately; tap again when you finish and the record is saved automatically. You never have to type in any times by hand.</p>\n<h2>Today&#39;s Hours and Earnings at a Glance</h2>\n<p>The clock page shows the live timer and adds up today&#39;s hours and estimated earnings. No more mental math about how long you actually worked today, and no digging through chat logs for clock-in screenshots — just open the app.</p>\n<h2>Automatic Reminder When You Enter Overtime</h2>\n<p>When the accumulated hours of your current shift cross into the overtime range, the app sends a local notification. Overtime is counted separately from that moment, making it easy to verify your overtime pay — and reminding you it might be time to head home.</p>\n<h2>From Tap to Record, Fully Automatic</h2>\n<p>Every clock-in is archived automatically with the start time, end time, duration, and the results calculated under your overtime rules. Afterwards you can review them on the records page, and see longer-term patterns in the statistics charts.</p>\n",
